      players: '2 or 4 in fixed partnerships.',
      deck: '36-card Italian deck: each suit has Ace, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, Jack, Queen, King (no 2s).',
      equipment: '36-card Italian deck.',
      dealing: '3 cards to each player, 4 face-up on the table. Two players: next three deals 3 cards each, last two deals 4 cards each. Four players: second deal 3 each, third deal 2 each.',
